{"articleNo":"63555","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=63555&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012년 비교과영역 취업트랙 1~2회차 신청자 마감 및 현황 공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.09.03","hit":"3892","attachments":[{"name":"비교과영역 취업트랙 1회차 접수현황.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=63555&attachNo=70631"},{"name":"비교과영역 취업트랙 2회차 접수현황.xlsx","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=63555&attachNo=70817"},{"name":"비교과영역 취업트랙 교육내용.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=63555&attachNo=70835"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#ff00dd\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">비교과영역 취업트랙 참가자 모집(1~2회차) 마감되어<font color=\"#0900ff\"> </font></span></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#ff00dd\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">신청자현황</font>을 <font color=\"#0900ff\">첨부</font>합니다.</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">신청자분들은 명단을 확인하시기 바라며, </font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">기타 문의사항은 취업지원본부로 문의하여 주시기 바랍니다.</font></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><font color=\"#ff00dd\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">3~4회차 참가자 모집은 추후 모집 예정입니다)</span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font color=\"#a6a6a6\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">□ 교육목적<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞ </span></font><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">기업의 채용 진행 시 스펙보다는 면접 등이 중요시되는 현황을 수렴하여, 기존 전공에<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 국한되지 않은 비교과영역의 취업트랙을 운영함으로써,&nbsp;서류작성요령 및 면접스킬 등의<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 취업에 직접적으로 영향을 주는 스킬 교육을 통한 취업성과 극대</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">화<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">□ 교육과목 </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">(※상세 내용은 첨부파일 참고)<br></font></span></span></span><font color=\"#a6a6a6\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞ </span>기업군별 취업전략, 입사서류 교육<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞ </span>면접교육(영어면접 포함), 면접 클리닉</span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">□ 교육일정</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞ </span>1회차 : </font><strong><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">2012. 9. 10(월) ~ 2012. 9. 14(금)<br></font></strong></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞ </span>2회차 : </font><strong><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">2012. 9. 17(월) ~ 2012. 9. 21(금)<br></font></strong></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞ </span>3~4회차 일정은 추후 공지 <br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">□ 교육시간</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\"> : 18:00~21:00(3H) (월~금 1일/3H, 총 5일/15H)<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">□ 교육장소 </font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">: 든사람교육센터(도서관211호)</font></span></p><p><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">□ 교육대상</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\"> : 금오공대 학부(과) 누구나<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">□ 교육인원</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\"> : 회차별 30명<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">□ 교육비용</font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\"><font color=\"#a6a6a6\"> : 교재 및 교육비 전액무료(학교에서 전액지원), 간식제공<br></font></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><br><font color=\"#a6a6a6\">□ 문 의 처 </font></span><font color=\"#a6a6a6\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt\">: 취업지원본부 (478-7984)</span> </font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\"></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
